---js
{
  layout: "layouts/index.njk",
  title: "Making",
  contentClass: "wide",
  // Everything made by hand, in one list: art, sketching (sketchnotes live
  // there too), sketchbooks and crafts (no crafts section yet; it'll show up
  // here once there is one). allPosts is already newest first.
  pagination: {
    data: "collections.allPosts",
    size: 12,
    generatePageOnEmptyData: true,
    before: (posts) => {
      const making = ["art", "sketching", "sketchbooks", "crafts"];
      return posts.filter((p) => [].concat(p.data.section || []).some((s) => making.includes(s)));
    }
  },
  permalink: (data) => `/making/${data.pagination.pageNumber > 0 ? `page/${data.pagination.pageNumber + 1}/` : ""}`,
  showImages: true,
  showSections: true,
  hideExcerpts: true,
  listClass: "art-grid",
  eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
}
---
<p class="index-intro">Things I've made, sketched or painted: <a href="/art/">art</a>, <a href="/sketching/">sketches and sketchnotes</a>, and pages from my <a href="/sketchbooks/">sketchbooks</a>.</p>
